{
 "_doc": "Warbound hero gear (skirmish loot). A classic rarity ladder on the main game's 7 slots. Common items have only their base stats; magic items roll 1-2 affixes (at most one prefix and one suffix); rare items roll 3-4 (at most two of each). Affix values grow by grow_per_level per item level above 1. Base items are the minor and major designs of the equipment artwork library (assets/source/equipment-002 in the main game). Uniques and set pieces are the main game's artifacts with their effects rewritten for real time, the library's relics, and its elemental legendaries (void, sunlight and blood uniques; poison, fire, frost and lightning sets). Every base and unique has an icon in assets/items/<id>.png (tools/sync_item_icons.py). Stats: attack, defense, power, knowledge (attribute points), damage (flat), damage_pct, attack_speed, hp, hp_regen (per s), mana, mana_regen (per s), move_pct, cooldown_pct, skill_pct, xp_pct, and army auras aura_might, aura_ward, aura_haste (own units within aura_radius). See src/sim/item_catalog.gd and src/sim/hero_gear.gd.",
